FADE IN:

INT. ORBITAL CANTEEN - NIGHT

Steam ghosts the viewport. Earth is a cold marble.

KIRA
We don't have long.

JON
Then we move before the next window.

She slides him a battered keycard.

KIRA
(quiet)
If this is a trap, I already know.

EXT. AIRLOCK CATWALK - NIGHT

Stars. No wind. The hull ticks as it cools.

JON
Go.

KIRA
You first.

He doesn't.

CUT TO:

INT. SERVICE SHAFT - NIGHT

Bolts. Dust. A child's drawing taped to a pipe.

JON
They lived here.

KIRA
They left.

FADE OUT:
